# This package is its own workspace root (see Cargo.toml), so it builds into its own `target/`
# directory rather than the repo's. The root `.gitignore`'s `/target/` is anchored to the repo
# root and does not reach here.
/target/

# Dated record files are evidence for a specific run on a specific host. They are written next to
# wherever the harness was invoked by default (`--record-dir`), never committed from here.
escape-conformance-*.md
